                <head>240. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>A bilateral agreement regulating civil aviation relations between Mexico and the
                    United States was concluded on March 7, 1957, through an exchange of notes by
                    Ambassador White and Foreign Minister Padilla Nervo in Mexico City. The
                    agreement entered into force on June 5, 1957. For text, see 3 UST (pt. 1)
                    295.</p>
            </div>
